[2026-05-07T14:11:45.662Z] [INFO] {"baseRefName":"main","body":"Fixes #2428\n\n## Summary\n- switched dashboard tile mode to default-on 12-column grid with responsive per-panel column spans\n- moved the tile mode button between dashboard settings and reset-size controls, and removed tile-width drag handles\n- replaced panel display size/max-width controls with panel min/max height and responsive column settings\n\n## Tests\n- `node --check js/dash.js`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `node experiments/test-issue-2428-dashboard-tile-layout.js`\n- `node experiments/test-issue-2366-dashboard-tile-mode.js`\n- `node experiments/test-issue-2368-dashboard-tile-mode-panel-width.js`\n- `node experiments/test-issue-2386-dashboard-tile-mode-resize.js`\n- `node experiments/test-issue-2421-dashboard-number-step.js`\n- `node experiments/test-issue-2284-dashboard-viz-size.js`\n- `node experiments/test-issue-2288-dashboard-selected-chart-rows.js`\n- `node experiments/test-issue-2296-dashboard-chart-resize.js`\n- `node experiments/test-issue-2336-dashboard-table-resize.js`\n- `node experiments/test-issue-2338-dashboard-panel-max-width.js`\n- `node experiments/test-issue-2340-dashboard-panel-width.js`\n- `node experiments/test-issue-2412-dashboard-general-settings.js`\n- `node experiments/test-issue-2414-dashboard-legend-and-small-fonts.js`\n- `node experiments/test-issue-2426-dashboard-color-palette.js`\n- `node experiments/test-issue-2356-dashboard-panel-icon-order.js`\n\n## Screenshot\n![Dashboard tile layout](https://github.com/ideav/crm/blob/issue-2428-81d8e5ef3a16/docs/screenshots/issue-2428-dashboard-tile-layout.png?raw=true)\n","headRefName":"issue-2428-81d8e5ef3a16","headRefOid":"be889949694369f19e0e72ea9927b02e90572f6c","isDraft":false,"mergeable":"UNKNOWN","number":2429,"state":"OPEN","statusCheckRollup":[],"title":"Доработать плиточный режим дэшборда","url":"https://github.com/ideav/crm/pull/2429"}
